WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.334 --> 00:00:03.734
-Performing her late father,
Chris Cornell's,

00:00:03.734 --> 00:00:06.100
cover of "Nothing Compares 2 U"
off his album

00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:09.133
"No One Sings Like You Anymore,"
both of which are nominated

00:00:09.133 --> 00:00:11.000
for Grammys,
here's Toni Cornell.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:14.100
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:16.100
♪♪

00:00:29.801 --> 00:00:36.567
-♪ It's been
7 hours and 15 days ♪

00:00:36.567 --> 00:00:40.701
♪ Since you took
your love away ♪

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:51.400
♪ I go out every night
and sleep all day ♪

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:55.801
♪ Since you took your
love away ♪

00:00:59.133 --> 00:01:06.267
♪ Since you been gone,
I can do whatever I want ♪

00:01:06.267 --> 00:01:10.200
♪ I can see whoever I choose ♪

00:01:13.701 --> 00:01:20.167
♪ I can eat my dinner in
a fancy restaurant ♪

00:01:20.167 --> 00:01:21.801
♪ But nothing ♪

00:01:21.801 --> 00:01:27.467
♪ I said nothing
can take away these blues ♪

00:01:27.467 --> 00:01:32.033
♪ 'Cause nothing compares ♪

00:01:32.033 --> 00:01:39.267
♪ Nothing compares to you ♪

00:01:43.467 --> 00:01:50.434
♪ It's been so
lonely without you here ♪

00:01:50.434 --> 00:01:54.400
♪ Like a bird without a song ♪

00:01:58.300 --> 00:02:04.200
♪ Nothing can stop these
lonely tears from falling ♪

00:02:04.200 --> 00:02:12.634
♪ Tell me, baby,
where did I go wrong? ♪

00:02:12.634 --> 00:02:20.033
♪ I could throw my arms around
every boy I see ♪

00:02:20.033 --> 00:02:24.234
♪ But they'd
only remind me of you ♪

00:02:27.667 --> 00:02:31.634
♪ I went to the doctor,
and guess what he told me ♪

00:02:31.634 --> 00:02:33.667
♪ Guess what he told me ♪

00:02:33.667 --> 00:02:36.868
♪ He said, "Girl,
you better try to have fun

00:02:36.868 --> 00:02:39.801
no matter what you do" ♪

00:02:39.801 --> 00:02:41.400
♪ But he's a fool ♪

00:02:41.400 --> 00:02:45.834
♪ 'Cause nothing compares ♪

00:02:45.834 --> 00:02:53.167
♪ Nothing compares to you ♪

00:02:54.667 --> 00:02:58.767
♪ All the flowers that
you planted, mama ♪

00:02:58.767 --> 00:03:02.501
♪ In the backyard ♪

00:03:02.501 --> 00:03:06.934
♪ All died when you went away ♪

00:03:09.934 --> 00:03:17.467
♪ I know that living with you,
baby, was sometimes hard ♪

00:03:17.467 --> 00:03:23.968
♪ But I'm willing to
give it another try ♪

00:03:23.968 --> 00:03:28.367
♪ 'Cause nothing compares ♪

00:03:28.367 --> 00:03:35.267
♪ Nothing compares to you ♪

00:03:35.267 --> 00:03:39.400
♪ Nothing compares ♪

00:03:39.400 --> 00:03:46.834
♪ Nothing compares to you ♪

00:03:46.834 --> 00:03:50.467
♪ Nothing compares ♪

00:03:50.467 --> 00:03:58.100
♪ Nothing compares to you ♪

00:03:58.100 --> 00:04:00.167
♪♪

00:04:02.767 --> 00:04:04.133
[ Cheers and applause ]

